    mc "一想到这个我就慌了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:186
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_c5816b56:

    # mc "Do you get what I mean, or did I explain it poorly?"
    mc "你明白我的意思了吗，还是我解释得不够清楚？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:188
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_a8829101:

    # isa "I understand you."
    isa "我懂你的意思。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:189
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_45d5ecf2:

    # isa "And what you say is true."
    isa "你说的没错。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:191
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_fe2f2657:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Fuck..."
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*操"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:193
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_45cc56ce:

    # isa "And you should know that I've been fighting the same battle in my head when I'm with you."
    isa "而且你该知道，每次和你在一起的时候，我脑子里也在打同样的仗。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:195
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_33cc6343:

    # mc "Like how?"
    mc "像你这样？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:197
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_65782c30:

    # isa "How can I feel for someone else when I'm already in love?"
    isa "我怎么能在爱着别人的时候，还去爱别人？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:198
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_f7cf6a29:

    # isa "Am I cheating on my husband with you?"
    isa "我在跟你出轨吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:200
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_f0bf951e:

    # isa "If he's still alive, I am. But if he's not... Am I moving on?"
    isa "如果他还在，那我还在。但如果他不在了……我是不是该继续往前走？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:202
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_8072699b:

    # isa "Like I told you... The days we spent together, we spent without a guide to follow."
    isa "就像我告诉过你……我们在一起的那些天，我们是毫无方向地度过的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:203
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_530f1de3:

    # isa "The way you and I have built our relationship... I feel like there's no right or wrong answer."
    isa "我们之间这段关系是怎么建立的……我觉得，根本没有对错之分。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:205
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_623c81df:

    # isa "You have your concerns, and I have mine."
    isa "你有自己的顾虑，我也有我的想法。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:206
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_6ff3000b:

    # isa "But we also have feelings for each other, and plenty of reasons to say what we do together is wrong."
    isa "但我们彼此也有感情，也有很多理由觉得我们做的事是错的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:208
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_3f2d1899:

    # isa "I'd ask you to feel for yourself what your heart desires, [name]."
    isa "我会让你自己感受你内心真正渴望的东西。[name]."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:209
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_97f7f276:

    # isa "Because the only one who can answer that is you."
    isa "因为只有你能回答这个问题。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:212
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_bed121ca:

    # mc "I care so much about you, Bella."
    mc "我真的很在乎你，贝拉。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:214
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_5a8103e0:

    # isa "I know. And it's ok to not know what to do."
    isa "我知道。不晓得该怎么做也没关系。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:216
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_9a6cf057:

    # mc "What about you? What will you do?"
    mc "你呢？你会怎么做？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:218
translate schinese ep12_bella_lib_label_e62228cc:

    # isa "I hope I'll be able to answer that same question one day."
    isa "我希望有一天也能回答同样的问题。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:230
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_e1e6a426:

    # mc "(I can probably guess what's on Bella's mind...)"
    mc "（我大概能猜到贝拉在想什么……）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:231
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_4add6a87:

    # mc "(It's all that's been on my mind since Sage found out what I did.)"
    mc "（从Sage知道我做了什么之后，这事儿就没断过我脑子）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:233
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_b5ab07a4:

    # mc "(Put me out of my misery already...)"
    mc "（快让我结束这种痛苦吧……）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:236
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_d5cae37a:

    # mc "(I wonder what's on Bella's mind...)"
    mc "（我真想知道贝拉在想什么……）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:238
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_9c449704:

    # mc "(I still think our situation is too much to handle.)"
    mc "（我觉得我们现在这种状况实在难以应付。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:239
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_848a9c14:

    # mc "(The more I think about it, the more I'm sure. I can't have it like this.)"
    mc "（我越想越确定，我不能这样下去。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:241
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_71d5c42a:

    # mc "(She's still in love with her husband, and I'm flirting with others.)"
    mc "（她还爱着她的丈夫，而我却在跟别人调情。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:242
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_9427bc7a:

    # mc "(I feel like that's not how it's supposed to be when you're in a relationship.)"
    mc "（我觉得感情里不该是这样。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:244
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_23b90f01:

    # mc "(I'm still unsure about how to handle our situation.)"
    mc "（我还是不太确定该怎么处理我们的关系。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:245
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_a99f617f:

    # mc "(And when I think about what's bothering me, it's quite clear...)"
    mc "（一想到让我困扰的事情，就特别清楚……）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:247
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_01dc3160:

    # mc "(She's still in love with her husband.)"
    mc "（她还爱着她的丈夫。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:248
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_cc2c49be:

    # mc "(And me... I'm in love with her.)"
    mc "（而我……我爱着她。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:249
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_63f7c506:

    # mc "(Fuck... It's not supposed to be that way in a relationship.)"
    mc "（操...这在恋爱里本不该是这样。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:250
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_9d494163:

    # mc "(And I don't know what to do about it.)"
    mc "（而且我也不知道该怎么办。）"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:252
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_dace37c4:

    # "*{i}Knocking{/i}*"
    "*{i}敲门{/i}*"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:255
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_baab6323:

    # mc "Welcome..."
    mc "欢迎..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:256
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_1a28d6c7:

    # mc "Finally done with the test, huh?"
    mc "终于考完了，是吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:258
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_c146a811:

    # isa "Yes. It was a long day. I bet yours was too."
    isa "是的。今天真是漫长的一天。我打赌你也是。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:260
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_77734fcd:

    # mc "Yep... I have a slight headache from focusing too much."
    mc "嗯……我因为太专注有点头痛。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:261
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_7182b1b9:

    # mc "Did you ever get that back when you were in college?"
    mc "你上大学的时候也经历过那种感觉吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:263
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_68ee986d:

    # isa "I remember getting sleepy after my tests. They do a good job of draining your energy."
    isa "我记得每次考完试都会犯困，那些考试真是把人折腾得够呛。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:265
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_7968f0a7:

    # mc "Yeah... How are you?"
    mc "嗯...你怎么样？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:267
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_af0182ec:

    # isa "I didn't come here to talk about the test. I...uh..."
    isa "我没来这儿是想谈考试的。我……呃……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:268
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_e7fd977f:

    # isa "I think it's time we have a talk, you and I."
    isa "我觉得我们该谈谈了，你和我。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:269
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_6421cbcf:

    # isa "Just us, with no one else around."
    isa "就我们俩，没人打扰。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:271
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_f0a7ab75:

    # mc "I think we need it. Get yourself comfortable. Can I get you anything? Coffee?"
    mc "我觉得我们得来点这个。你先放松一下。我能给你拿点什么吗？咖啡？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:273
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_7f13611c:

    # isa "I wouldn't say no to a cup, thanks."
    isa "我也不介意来一杯，谢谢。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:277
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_8884bcf5:

    # isa "I got together with the girls, and we talked about what you did."
    isa "我和女孩们聚在一起，聊了聊你干了什么。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:279
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_2d37093f:

    # mc "With everyone?"
    mc "和所有人？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:281
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_9f577182:

    # isa "With Sage, Jill, Josy and Maya."
    isa "和Jill、Josy、Maya还有Sage一起。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:282
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_770a80df:

    # isa "We tried to make sense of it all. And while we could find some understanding of why it happened, that doesn't mean we could accept it."
    isa "我们试着理解这一切。虽然我们能明白为什么会发生这些事，但这并不意味着我们能接受。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:284
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:286
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_10211268:

    # isa "You've done something terrible, [name], and you're smart enough to know it."
    isa "你做了可怕的事，[name]，你聪明得知道这一点。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:287
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_f6afc79f:

    # isa "Having sex with Jade... I get it. I can't say I don't because I'm sitting on this couch with you."
    isa "和Jade发生关系……我明白。我不能说我不明白，因为我正坐在你旁边这张沙发上。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:289
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_2533902b:

    # isa "And it's not that I take issue with. Why did you have to record it and show it to your friends?"
    isa "而且我也不介意你这么做。问题是，你为什么非要把录像拿出来给朋友们看？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:291
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_ec09e484:

    # mc "It was for Hell Week. They needed proof that I did that, but I shouldn't have given it to them."
    mc "那是为了地狱周。他们需要证明我确实做了那事，但我不该把证据给他们看。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:293
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_09f2e413:

    # isa "Bingo. You shouldn't."
    isa "答对了。你的确不该那么做。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:298
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_942ef527:

    # mc "It doesn't help that I was constantly buzzed from beer all that week."
    mc "这周我一直在啤酒的作用下晕晕乎乎的，也没帮上忙。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:300
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_efbb1e21:

    # isa "No, [name]. You can't blame it on alcohol. It wasn't the alcohol that did all that. It was you."
    isa "不，[name]你不能把责任推给酒精。不是酒精让你这么做的，是你自己。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:303
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_66f8f5b0:

    # mc "I made a mistake. And I will live with that forever."
    mc "我犯了一个错。而且我将永远为此负责。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:305
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_f62f9d18:

    # isa "Yes, you did."
    isa "是的，你确实这么做了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:306
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_6086a994:

    # isa "You're allowed to make mistakes; everyone makes them."
    isa "你可以犯错；每个人都会犯错。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:307
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_700a4ff7:

    # isa "But the mistakes also come with consequences. Your actions affect others in ways that could be permanent."
    isa "但错误也会带来后果。你的行为会影响别人，而且这种影响可能是永远都无法挽回的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:309
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_9048b8fc:

    # isa "I'm not going to speak on behalf of the rest of the girls, but from what I heard during our talk, it sounded like a group of girls who were severely disappointed in you."
    isa "我不会代表其他女孩们说话，但从我们谈话中听到的情况来看，听起来是一群对你非常失望的女孩。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:310
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_80bf1b32:

    # isa "They saw you as a close friend, someone they adored, and now they fear they can't go back to that."
    isa "他们把你当成了亲密的朋友，甚至非常喜爱你，而现在他们害怕再也回不去了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:312
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_fe5ea3c0:

    # isa "I know you're not a rotten person. I know you have many great sides, and we have had a wonderful time together."
    isa "我知道你不是个坏人。我知道你有很多优点，我们在一起的时候也度过了一些美好的时光。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:313
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_4291928f:

    # isa "But even I was affected by this. And I had to ask myself what I am doing together with you."
    isa "但就连我都被这件事影响了。我不得不问自己，我为什么还和你在一起。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:315
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_0128d9b7:

    # isa "I started imagining how I would feel if I were Jade, or if you ever put me in a similar situation."
    isa "我开始设想，如果我是Jade，或者你哪天也让我陷入类似处境，我会是什么感受。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:316
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_ae3c3b59:

    # isa "While Jade and I are different, we do share similarities. And those similarities made this feel all too real."
    isa "虽然我和Jade性格不同，但我们也有相似之处。正是这些相似之处，让这一切感觉格外真实。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:318
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_22d4d0a9:

    # mc "I would never do that to you, Bella."
    mc "我怎么会对你做那种事，贝拉。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:320
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_865548ae:

    # isa "I want to believe that. But I also have proof that you could slip up detrimentally."
    isa "我想相信你说的话。但我也有证据证明你可能会犯下致命的错误。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:321
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_6645f269:

    # isa "You and I are far from a perfect couple. We're no fairytale; we've faced challenges since day one."
    isa "我们俩远称不上是完美的一对。我们不是童话故事；从一开始到现在，我们就一直在面对各种挑战。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:322
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_6a66b30a:

    # isa "I think this is a sign that we shouldn't be together."
    isa "我觉得这说明我们不应该在一起了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:324
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_5eda9b0d:

    # mc "So, you're breaking up with me after all?"
    mc "所以，你最后还是决定跟我分手了？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:326
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_147f6ec6:

    # isa "It pains me to do this. I won't feel better from doing it, but I know myself. I can't forget what you did."
    isa "这样做让我很痛心。我做这件事不会感觉好受，但我清楚自己。我无法忘记你做过的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:330
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_7d9199bd:

    # mc "I'm so sorry."
    mc "我真的很抱歉。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:332
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_cf574ad3:

    # isa "I know. And I forgive you."
    isa "我知道。我原谅你了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:333
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_16681290:

    # isa "And I wish you nothing but the best."
    isa "而且我希望你一切安好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:335
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_f3128b97:

    # mc "{i}When Bella broke up with me, I couldn't blame her.{/i}"
    mc "{i}当贝拉和我分手时，我无法责怪她。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:336
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_6d16b064:

    # mc "{i}I regretted what I had done, and what I had failed to do was to realize how many were affected by my mistake.{/i}"
    mc "{i}我后悔自己所做的事，而我未能意识到我的错误影响了多少人。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:338
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_1c75d930:

    # mc "{i}Sometimes in life, you don't get a second chance.{/i}"
    mc "{i}有时候，人生中你没有第二次机会。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:343
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_b81d1d94:

    # isa "So... Where do we begin?"
    isa "那……我们从哪里开始呢？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:345
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_label_65375dd2:

    # mc "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I feel like I'll be all over the place. But we have to start somewhere..."
    mc "*{i}叹气{/i}*我觉得我可能会到处乱撞。但我们要从某处开始……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:357
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_84730438:

    # mc "I'd like to talk some more about James. And I'm afraid my questions might come off as insensitive, but I have to ask them..."
    mc "我想再聊聊James。恐怕我的问题听起来有点冒犯，但有些事我必须问。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:359
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_67b6ba54:

    # isa "What do you want to know?"
    isa "你想知道什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:361
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_f2fe282b:

    # mc "It's been a long time since he went missing, right?"
    mc "他失踪已经很久了，对吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:363
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_9134723c:

    # isa "Longer than three years."
    isa "比三年还长。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:365
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_aea6cacd:

    # mc "And after he disappeared and you got that call about it... Did you hear any news?"
    mc "然后他失踪了，你接到那个电话……你有没有听到什么消息？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:367
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_7dabbb98:

    # isa "After he went missing, a case was opened to find him. And I got support from a case manager who handled the economics and everything surrounding it."
    isa "在他失踪后，他们开了一个案子来找他。我还有一位案件管理员，负责处理相关的经济事务和其他一切事情。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:368
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_45118a7d:

    # isa "But any news of his whereabouts or progress on their search was limited."
    isa "但关于他下落或搜寻进展的消息寥寥无几。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:370
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_5837a124:

    # isa "At first, it felt comforting knowing that they were actively searching for him."
    isa "一开始知道他们正在积极搜寻他，感觉还挺安心的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:371
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_19e1723b:

    # isa "But as time passed, it got me upset that they didn't manage to find him."
    isa "但随着时间过去，我开始感到不安，他们竟然没能找到他。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:373
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_6a535f88:

    # isa "I called and pleaded. I asked for any signs of life or new information. I wanted them to give me something to hold on to..."
    isa "我打电话过去，苦苦哀求。我想要任何一丝生命的迹象，任何新的消息。我想让他们给我点东西，让我能抓住点希望……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:374
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e3639dd1:

    # isa "But they couldn't tell me anything I didn't already know."
    isa "但他们什么也无法告诉我，我早已知道的一切。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:376
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_2e5c8abb:

    # mc "So, he could still be alive, or he could have been dead all this time, and you wouldn't know."
    mc "所以他可能还活着，也可能早就死了，你永远都不会知道。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:378
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_b610964f:

    # isa "Living with that ambiguity has been the hardest part."
    isa "生活在这种模棱两可之中，是最难熬的部分。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:379
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_989d60ea:

    # isa "I compared it to the loss of my parents, and losing James has been way worse."
    isa "我把这比作失去父母的感觉，但失去James的痛苦要严重得多。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:381
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e245cbb8:

    # isa "With my parents - as hard as that was - at least it was final. I could grieve them knowing that they wouldn't come back."
    isa "和我父母的离世——虽然那很难受——至少是结束了。我可以为他们哀悼，知道他们不会再回来了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:382
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_39eccaaa:

    # isa "There was closure, and there was acceptance."
    isa "我得到了一个了结，也接受了现实。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:383
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_4cbb7f3c:

    # isa "But with James, I don't have any closure. There's no comfort to be had from thinking that he's alive and captured, or tortured, or...or..."
    isa "但James的事没有任何了结。想到他也许还活着，却被囚禁、受折磨，或者……或者……这根本带不来任何安慰。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:385
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_3c32652a:

    # isa "And there's no comfort from thinking that he's dead and never to be found either."
    isa "而且连想着他死了、永远找不到了，也得不到任何安慰。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:387
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_f5195339:

    # mc "I can't imagine how horrible that must feel for you."
    mc "我真不敢想象你当时的感觉有多糟。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:388
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_9f6092c0:

    # mc "If we assume that he's not coming back..."
    mc "如果我们假设他不会回来了……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:389
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_53d53015:

    # mc "Sorry... I know it's not something you want to think about."
    mc "抱歉...我知道你不想去想这些。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:391
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_103899e6:

    # isa "Go on."
    isa "继续说吧。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:393
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_2430192e:

    # mc "If we assume that he's not coming back, what are your plans? Do you intend to stay married to him, or what is the process here?"
    mc "如果我们假设他再也回不来了，你打算怎么办？你打算继续和他结婚吗？还是说这里有什么流程？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:395
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_20858b6e:

    # isa "I've had it explained to me. In a couple of years from now, if he's still missing, he can be declared deceased."
    isa "我听别人解释过。如果他在几年后仍然下落不明，就可以被宣布为死亡。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:396
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_7287f264:

    # isa "If that happens, our marriage will be dissolved. There's also an option for me to divorce him before that."
    isa "如果那样的话，我们的婚姻就会自动解除。另外，我也可以在他失踪之前先提出离婚。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:398
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_3329985c:

    # isa "But I haven't thought about going through with either of those processes."
    isa "但我还没想过要走其中任何一个流程。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:400
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_56c3991c:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "为什么不去做呢？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:402
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_cefaa43b:

    # isa "Because I never wanted them. I wanted to stay married to him, and I wanted him to be alive."
    isa "因为我从没想要过他们。我想和他继续结婚，我也希望他还能活着。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:409
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_a39a1ded:

    # mc "Can we talk about your child? Um... Your daughter."
    mc "我们能谈谈你的孩子吗？呃……你的女儿。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:411
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_6f198133:

    # mc "I know it's not easy for you, but if I don't ask..."
    mc "我知道对你来说也不容易，但如果不问我……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:413
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_31b31fd5:

    # isa "I know. We'll keep avoiding it."
    isa "我知道。我们就这样避开这个话题吧。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:414
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_eda5d7d0:

    # isa "But [name], this is a difficult topic for me."
    isa "但[name]这对我来说是个困难的话题。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:416
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_8b99c9ba:

    # mc "I get it..."
    mc "我明白……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:418
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e82533ed:

    # isa "We talked about naming her Emily. I lost her due to the trauma I faced during pregnancy."
    isa "我们曾讨论过给她取名叫艾米莉。我因为怀孕期间遭遇的创伤失去了她。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:420
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_a30b83e6:

    # mc "And you kept her nursery in that way for James, yeah? And you locked the door to it."
    mc "你一直用那种方式布置她的婴儿房，对吧？还把门锁上了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:422
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_4a225dce:

    # isa "Yes."
    isa "嗯。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:424
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_ce917d10:

    # mc "I don't understand why."
    mc "我不明白为什么。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:426
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_4b706af3:

    # isa "I believe I told you why. I felt like I had to leave it that way for James."
    isa "我相信我之前已经告诉过你原因了。我觉得我必须这样留着，是为了你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:428
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_fa5b9f76:

    # mc "That must have been painful for you to do. Why would you keep it that way for him?"
    mc "这对你来说一定很痛苦。你为什么还要让他一直保留着？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:429
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_0f82d61f:

    # mc "You lost Emily already. But you kept that constant reminder of her in your home."
    mc "你已经失去了艾米丽了。可你却还把那个提醒你的东西留在家里。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:431
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_b2e66996:

    # mc "And you didn't even tell Jill about that room. And again... You locked it."
    mc "你连Jill都没告诉他那个房间的事。而且……你又把它锁起来了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:432
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_297516e6:

    # mc "I have a hard time understanding why you would do that to yourself."
    mc "我很难理解你为什么要这样对待自己。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:433
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_ddeeb5f7:

    # mc "It's something that won't make you feel better. Right?"
    mc "这东西根本不会让你感觉好点。对吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:435
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_aba5c613:

    # mc "You can't possibly look at that room with joy. And it's a constant reminder of your loss."
    mc "你根本不可能看着那间屋子感到开心。它一直在提醒你失去她的痛苦。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:436
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_da25bf00:

    # mc "To me, it doesn't sound healthy. Can you help me understand it?"
    mc "对我来说，这听起来不健康。你能帮我理解一下吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:438
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_ec40c455:

    # isa "It's just been me alone in that house, [name]."
    isa "我独自待在那栋房子里[name]."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:439
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_d1da5bcc:

    # isa "A part of me knows that her nursery keeps me grieving, but I don't have the power to turn that room into anything else."
    isa "我明白她的婴儿房让我一直沉浸在悲伤里，但我也无力把那间屋子变成别的样子。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:441
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_d6752745:

    # isa "It used to be my parents' bedroom. Now they rest in their urns in that room."
    isa "它以前是父母的卧室。现在他们安息在那个房间的骨灰盒里。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:442
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_0649f6e1:

    # isa "I feel like they rest in there together with Emily's spirit."
    isa "我觉得他们就在那里一起安息，连艾米丽的魂灵也在。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:443
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_036e76dd:

    # isa "And while the room itself makes me sad, I feel like I get comfort from those thoughts, too."
    isa "虽然那个房间本身让我难过，但那些想法也给我带来一些安慰。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:444
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_b057a732:

    # isa "That they rest together in there, and that I can visit them when I feel the need."
    isa "他们就在那里安息在一起，而我需要的时候也能去见他们。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:449
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_8209fd6d:

    # mc "Bella, I'm worried about you."
    mc "贝拉，我担心你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:450
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_c532ed50:

    # mc "You've been through so much that you decided to...to..."
    mc "你经历的太多了，你决定……决定……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:451
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_fc295d3f:

    # mc "Fuck, I can't even say the words."
    mc "操，我都说不出来了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:453
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_03813d30:

    # isa "I know."
    isa "我知道。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:455
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_6ea180c9:

    # mc "It worries me that you already went to that dark place in your mind once before."
    mc "这让我担心的是，你已经一度走进了那种黑暗的念头里。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:456
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_27d43c5d:

    # mc "Could it happen again?"
    mc "会不会再发生一次？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:458
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_c92fb893:

    # isa "I'm ashamed of what I did to myself, [name]."
    isa "我为自己所做的事感到羞愧[name]."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:459
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_81766396:

    # isa "I've always thought of myself as someone brave and strong, but in that moment, I felt tiny and scared."
    isa "我一向觉得自己是个勇敢坚强的人，但那一刻，我感觉自己渺小又害怕。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:460
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_09873536:

    # isa "I can't rationalize it. I wasn't myself, and I wanted it to be over. I didn't want to feel that way anymore."
    isa "我没办法用理性去解释。我当时已经不是自己了，只想结束这一切。我不想再感觉这样了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:462
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_d89fc1ee:

    # mc "And what about after it happened? Did you still feel that way? And what about now?"
    mc "那之后呢？你还是那样吗？现在呢？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:464
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_0b5286e9:

    # isa "It was tough to wake up and realize what I had done. Sadness and regret set in instantly."
    isa "醒来时很难接受自己做了什么，悲伤和悔恨立刻涌上心头。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:465
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_47ea763f:

    # isa "I got plenty of help to process what I went through. And that was what I needed."
    isa "我得到了很多帮助来处理我经历的一切。那正是我需要的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:467
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_65d23e4c:

    # isa "When James went M.I.A., I was offered help too, but I declined it. If I had only accepted it to begin with, maybe it wouldn't have come to this."
    isa "当James消失不见时，我也被提供了帮助，但我拒绝了。如果当初我肯接受帮助，也许就不会走到这一步。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:468
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e61ba7dd:

    # isa "But I can't know that for sure. What I do know is that the group sessions helped me heal."
    isa "但我不能确定那一切真的结束了。我知道的是，团体辅导帮助我走出了伤痛。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:470
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_3a0b2d80:

    # isa "You don't have to worry about me doing {b}that{/b} again."
    isa "你不用担心我会{b}那{/b}又。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:471
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_00c5d7fd:

    # isa "Mentally, I'm in a much better place today."
    isa "从心理上来说，我现在好多了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:472
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_60103700:

    # isa "Granted, I still have a hard time sharing, but I think I've proven lately that I'm getting there."
    isa "虽然我仍然很难开口分享，但我认为最近我已经证明了自己正在慢慢好起来。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:474
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_7160fcc5:

    # isa "Most of it is thanks to Jill. But some of it is also thanks to you."
    isa "大部分都是多亏了Jill，不过也多亏了你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:479
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_922bc4f4:

    # mc "I didn't realize how important Jill has been to you. I knew she was a close friend of yours, but she seems to be so much more to you than that."
    mc "我没意识到Jill对你有多重要。我知道她是你的亲密朋友，但她对你来说似乎远不止是朋友那么简单。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:481
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_8f3beb0e:

    # isa "Jill is my angel. After I met her, she quickly became pivotal to me."
    isa "Jill是我生命里的天使。自从遇见她之后，她很快就成了我最重要的人。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:482
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_a5f04387:

    # isa "She was so easy to talk to. She made me feel heard and supported."
    isa "她特别容易聊得来，让我觉得被理解、被支持。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:484
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_aea3f92f:

    # isa "But more importantly, she made me feel needed."
    isa "但更重要的是，她让我觉得自己是被需要的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:486
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e4ed5194:

    # mc "In what way?"
    mc "怎么个重要法？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:488
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_8b918a87:

    # isa "She had experienced loss, too. And loss isn't something you deal with once, and then you're done."
    isa "她也经历过失去。而失去这种事，不是一次就能解决的，它会一直缠着你，反复出现。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:489
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_775ab6ea:

    # isa "It's something that can keep you up at night and return to visit you when you least expect it."
    isa "这东西能让你整夜睡不着，等你最不期待的时候又突然来找你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:491
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_760fd40d:

    # isa "Jill had been fighting her own dark thoughts about Lana for many years."
    isa "Jill多年来一直在为Lana的事情挣扎着痛苦。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:492
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_9fcf0b98:

    # isa "She still has nightmares about it. And she can never forget the moment when they told her Lana had passed away."
    isa "她到现在还会做那个梦。而且她永远忘不了他们告诉她Lana去世的那个时刻。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:494
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_dcde2d4c:

    # isa "And then, later in life, to learn that her parents had lied to her about how Lana died..."
    isa "然后，后来在她的人生中，得知她的父母曾对她隐瞒了Lana是怎么死的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:495
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_0dbdc724:

    # isa "That made it a lot worse for her."
    isa "这让她更难受了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:497
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_60ab60bd:

    # isa "We have spent many late nights talking about ourselves to one another."
    isa "我们曾花了很多个深夜互相倾诉彼此的想法。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:498
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_39fdf908:

    # isa "Often dedicating a whole night to each other's thoughts."
    isa "常常花一整晚交流彼此的想法。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:499
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_0b6bc0fb:

    # isa "And that's how I felt that I was needed. She needed me to listen and to give her input. She needed my comfort."
    isa "就是这样，我感觉到自己被需要了。她需要我倾听，需要我的意见。她需要我的安慰。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:501
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_aa763702:

    # isa "And that's why our bond is something special."
    isa "这就是为什么我们的羁绊如此特别。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:502
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e37803ab:

    # isa "I am ashamed that I kept the nursery from her in our talks..."
    isa "我羞愧的是，在我们谈话中一直瞒着她那个育儿室的事……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:503
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_8530968d:

    # isa "But she was always understanding with me. She never pushed me beyond what I was willing to share with her."
    isa "但她一直都很理解我。她从不会逼我说出我愿意跟她分享的东西。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:505
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_3c4ab333:

    # mc "Your relationship sounds...amazing. It makes me even sadder knowing it got tested when you and I got together..."
    mc "你俩的关系听起来……真是棒。知道它在你和我在一起后受到考验，让我更难过。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:508
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_7bcfe3db:

    # isa "I know you had feelings for her, [name]."
    isa "我知道你对她有感情，[name]."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:510
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_b1cf6e64:

    # mc "I did, but-"
    mc "我确实知道了，但——"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:512
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_a0df3541:

    # isa "And I know you kissed her around Halloween."
    isa "而且我知道你万圣节前后吻过她。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:514
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_dba5ea38:

    # mc "Did she tell you that?"
    mc "她跟你说过吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:516
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_468cf03d:

    # isa "She said you chose to be with me because you couldn't choose both of us."
    isa "她说你选择和我在一起，是因为你无法同时选择我们两个。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:517
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_7579d34e:

    # isa "And she said she had feelings for you, too."
    isa "而且她说她对你也有感觉。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:521
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_04d26c87:

    # mc "Why are you telling me this?"
    mc "你为什么现在才告诉我这些？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:523
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_e35874db:

    # isa "Why haven't you told me?"
    isa "你为什么不告诉我？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:525
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_76335656:

    # mc "It's been complicated."
    mc "这事儿挺复杂的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:527
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_1c4b1130:

    # isa "My relationship with Jill has also been complicated."
    isa "我和Jill的关系也挺复杂的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:529
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_3e0f40d2:

    # mc "Hm? You mean because of what I did?"
    mc "嗯？你是说因为我做了什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:531
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_d6f8f6d7:

    # isa "Before we met you."
    isa "在我们认识你之前。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:533
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_71392fbf:

    # mc "I'm confused... Did something happen between you two?"
    mc "我有点迷糊……你们之间发生什么事了？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:535
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_78631b50:

    # isa "Late nights... The need to feel comfort..."
    isa "深夜……想要被安慰的感觉……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:536
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_26e46c34:

    # isa "It shouldn't have happened, but it did."
    isa "本该不会发生的事，却还是发生了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:538
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_f0249583:

    # isa "It's weird that the three of us have that in common."
    isa "我们三个居然有这种共同点，挺奇怪的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:539
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_02dffbaa:

    # isa "And for reasons I can't quite explain, it made it even more difficult for me to see Jill miss out on you."
    isa "而且出于某种连我自己也说不清的原因，一想到Jill会失去你，我就更加难受。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:541
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_373e75ad:

    # mc "I don't know what to say... Um..."
    mc "我不知道该说什么……嗯……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:543
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_4f9d1067:

    # isa "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Me neither. I shouldn't have gotten into it."
    isa "*{i}叹气{/i}*我也不该卷进去。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:546
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_loop_label_7aa06545:

    # isa "We survived it."
    isa "我们挺过来了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:551
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_3e07d8de:

    # mc "Thank you for sharing all this with me... I've learned a great deal about you from your answers."
    mc "谢谢你跟我分享这些……从你的回答中，我学到了很多关于你的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:553
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_edc52205:

    # isa "It feels good to have told you. But also worrisome, because I'm scared about how you will react to all of it."
    isa "说出来感觉挺好的，但也很担心，因为我害怕你听到这些之后会怎么反应。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:554
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_b145c257:

    # isa "I'm sure you have your concerns now."
    isa "我确定你现在也有很多顾虑。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:556
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_36c4b17c:

    # mc "What worries me is something you said... You said you wanted to stay married to James..."
    mc "让我担心的是你刚才说的一句话……你说你想要和James继续维持婚姻……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:557
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_3c8ef520:

    # mc "And, of course, you want him to still be alive."
    mc "当然，你希望他还能活。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:559
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_b955a6c4:

    # mc "But this increases the worry I already have. And I keep coming back to it..."
    mc "但这让我更担心了。我一直在想这件事……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:560
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_beefcfb4:

    # mc "What about me? What about us?"
    mc "那我呢？我们呢？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:563
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_e00227b8:

    # mc "I have thought long and hard about this, and I've come to a realization."
    mc "我仔细想过很久，终于明白了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:565
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_eba5d2fc:

    # mc "You're still in love with your husband, and I've been flirting around with others."
    mc "你还是爱着你的丈夫，而我一直在和其他人调情。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:567
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_b5fc7ee9:

    # isa "You have?"
    isa "你有？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:570
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_5b8fb3e3:

    # mc "Yeah... I have. A lot, actually."
    mc "嗯...我确实有。而且很多。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:572
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_4fd5e4df:

    # mc "Yeah... I have."
    mc "嗯……我确实有。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:573
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_555b6847:

    # mc "You don't do that when you're in a relationship."
    mc "你谈恋爱的时候可不会这么干。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:574
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_03316ba1:

    # mc "And I also feel like it's a weird relationship to have when the one you're with loves someone else."
    mc "而且我感觉，当身边的人还爱着别人的时候，这种关系本身就挺奇怪的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:576
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_caba55ba:

    # mc "And that's what makes this so damned difficult."
    mc "而这正是让这一切变得如此该死困难的原因。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:577
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_a4b1131b:

    # mc "I'm scared that I will do you more harm than good."
    mc "我怕我会对你造成更多的伤害，而不是带来好处。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:579
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_34d555c3:

    # mc "I'm scared that you won't be able to love me the way you love James, and I'm scared that I'm not worth the effort to begin with."
    mc "我害怕你无法像爱你的James那样爱我，我也害怕自己从一开始就不值得你付出努力。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:580
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_ed868635:

    # mc "On top of that, we're doing something unethical that can land us both in trouble..."
    mc "除此之外，我们还在做一件不道德的事，可能会让我们俩都惹上麻烦……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:582
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_40a154d8:

    # mc "I feel so thankful that you've opened up to me like this, and I don't want you to think it's because of opening up that I'm saying this to you now..."
    mc "我真的很感激你愿意这样对我敞开心扉，我不想你误会，我现在的这番话并不是因为你愿意跟我说这些才说的……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:583
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_d97d0da2:

    # mc "But I don't believe we will last long-term. And I think it's best if we end it today."
    mc "但我认为我们不会长久。我觉得今天就该结束算了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:589
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_4fbf252d:

    # isa "I'm aware that I come with a truckload of baggage. And I buy into your reasoning."
    isa "我知道我带着一堆麻烦。我认同你的想法。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:590
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_e66be1dc:

    # isa "But I have to admit, it hurts to hear that you've been up to no good while you were with me."
    isa "但不得不说，听到你在和我在一起的时候干了那些见不得人的事，真的很伤人。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:591
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_3c658e7c:

    # isa "That's not something you should take lightly, [name]. Have you been cheating on me?"
    isa "这可不是能轻描淡写带过的事，[name]。你背着我出轨了吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:593
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_7bd74932:

    # mc "I have done things I'm not proud of. Things you don't do when you're in a committed relationship."
    mc "我做过一些我不以为荣的事。一些在认真恋爱关系里不会做的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:594
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_ba4ad9df:

    # mc "It wasn't just one single thing I did, and it all depends on where you draw the line for cheating."
    mc "这不只是一次我做过的错事，而且到底算不算出轨，全看你怎么定义了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:596
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_d3f95189:

    # mc "But I know that what I did, I wouldn't want you to do with someone else."
    mc "但我知道我做过的事，我可不希望你拿去跟别人做。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:597
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_dbc56ad9:

    # mc "So, yeah... I've crossed lines I shouldn't have crossed."
    mc "所以啊……我确实越过了不该越过的界限。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:599
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_fb50fc0e:

    # mc "I think I've felt that I'm not ready for a relationship. I mean, why else would I have done that?"
    mc "我想我可能还没准备好进入一段关系。我是说，不然我为什么会那样做？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:600
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_e8c3c1e3:

    # mc "I could stand here lying to you and say that I only have eyes for you..."
    mc "我完全可以站在这里骗你说，我眼里只有你……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:601
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_616764e3:

    # mc "But I have felt the temptation, and I've caved to it in a way that I'm not proud of."
    mc "但我确实感受到了诱惑，而且我以一种我不骄傲的方式屈服了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:605
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_63b06217:

    # isa "[name]..."
    isa "[name]……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:606
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_2767778c:

    # isa "We never stood a chance, did we?"
    isa "我们从一开始就毫无胜算，对吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:608
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_749c9267:

    # mc "I'm afraid we have too much against us to make it last."
    mc "我怕我们之间有太多东西阻碍着，让这段关系持续下去。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:612
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_958255a0:

    # mc "{i}And that's how I broke up with Bella...{/i}"
    mc "{i}就是这样我跟贝拉分手的...{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:613
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_162bc590:

    # mc "{i}It was a long and illuminating conversation, but ultimately, I had to do it.{/i}"
    mc "{i}这是一场漫长而富有启发性的谈话，但最终我不得不这么做。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:615
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_36e9c022:

    # mc "{i}I knew it would hurt her, but I felt confident knowing that she would be ok without me.{/i}"
    mc "{i}我知道这会伤她，但我确信她没有我也能没事。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:621
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_7731cf48:

    # mc "I'm scared that you won't be able to love me the way you love James."
    mc "我害怕你没办法像爱你的James那样爱我。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:622
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_1e0710a5:

    # mc "And I know that's a harsh thing to ask for. But if love isn't the point of this...then what is?"
    mc "我知道这样说有点狠。但如果爱不是这一切的初衷，那到底是为了什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:624
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_09400526:

    # isa "Are you with me because you really want love?"
    isa "你是因为真心想要爱我才和我在一起的吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:626
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_c9e97796:

    # mc "I am. That's what I've realized."
    mc "我是。这就是我意识到的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:627
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_0a6b08a1:

    # mc "It's ok if you don't feel the same, because I get it."
    mc "没关系，如果你感受不到同样的感情，我理解。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:628
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_cfa4453e:

    # mc "But I love you. And I love us. I want you to be able to feel that for me someday, too."
    mc "但我爱你。我也爱我们。我希望有一天，你也能为我感受到这份爱。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:630
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_63b06217_1:

    # isa "[name]..."
    isa "[name]……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:634
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_2b603920:

    # isa "I already feel that for you."
    isa "我早就这么感觉了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:636
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_81709362:

    # mc "You do?"
    mc "你真的吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:638
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_888bdafd:

    # isa "Yes, of course."
    isa "当然，我早就这么想了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:639
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_f59ac631:

    # isa "I love you too."
    isa "我也爱你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:641
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_22f27c2d:

    # mc "Wow... That feels amazing to hear..."
    mc "哇……听到这句话感觉真棒……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:644
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_358faad2:

    # isa "That's lovely to hear. I'm not quite there yet, but I'm heading in that direction."
    isa "听到你这么说真让人开心。我还没到那一步，但正在往那个方向走。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:646
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_16c61655:

    # mc "That's fine. All I need to know is that you might feel that way at some point."
    mc "这样就很好。我只需要知道你有时候可能会这么感觉。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:648
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_1e743440:

    # isa "I can't promise you anything, but I do have loving feelings for you."
    isa "我不能向你承诺什么，但我确实对你有爱慕之情。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:650
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_273cdba2:

    # mc "Ok... I'll take that."
    mc "好的，我接受。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:652
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_d5e050f9:

    # isa "*{i}Sigh{/i}* But it doesn't make the situation easier for us. Because the rest is still true..."
    isa "*{i}叹气{/i}*但这对我们的情况并没有帮助，因为其余部分仍然成立……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:653
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_00b36247:

    # isa "I have been living on hope for so long that stopping to feel hope is a way of letting go."
    isa "我活了这么久，一直都是靠希望活着，现在停止去抱希望，就是一种放手的方式。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:655
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_479c5fb2:

    # isa "And that's the hardest part for me. To let go."
    isa "而这对我最难。放手。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:656
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_541e6a65:

    # isa "I'm so torn. *{i}Sniffles{/i}*"
    isa "我真的左右为难。*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:658
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_6a1891c0:

    # mc "It's ok."
    mc "没关系。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:659
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_9b7a3b65:

    # mc "You have to live with this burden. And I'll help you carry it."
    mc "你得带着这个负担活下去。而我会帮你分担。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:661
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_4d0dbf41:

    # mc "I'll have to live with it, too. I'll be brutally honest here; it will be hard for me."
    mc "我也得一直带着这个负担活下去。我在这里说句实话，对我而言这会很难。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:662
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_e45c73b6:

    # mc "But I want to do it. I really do."
    mc "但我真的想这么做。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:664
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_ff3e3654:

    # isa "Thank you, [name]. Thank you for making this easier for me."
    isa "谢谢，[name]谢谢你让事情变得更容易。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:665
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_1f1f31ae:

    # isa "I never wanted you to have to live with this uncertainty, too."
    isa "我从没想过你也得承受这种不确定。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:667
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_b60ea343:

    # isa "But stopping here and now with you... That's not an option either."
    isa "但现在就停下来，和你这样……那也不是个选择。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:668
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_3ecfb4d0:

    # isa "That would take away one of the few things I love about my life."
    isa "那会让我失去生活中为数不多让我感到快乐的事之一。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:669
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_96705d64:

    # isa "And that's not happening."
    isa "这可不会发生。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:675
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_a59282ef:

    # mc "Then, we're on the same page."
    mc "那我们就达成一致了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:677
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_468a04d3:

    # isa "And on to another chapter."
    isa "接着开启新的篇章。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:679
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_03a51b4c:

    # mc "Yeah. Let's end that chapter on a high note. I wonder what the next one holds for us."
    mc "嗯，就让这一章以高光时刻收尾吧。我好奇下一章会给我们带来什么。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:681
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_91472a17:

    # isa "Well... First, you're going to have your winter break and I'll have mine."
    isa "那好吧……首先，你有寒假，我也有我的假期。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:682
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_87ae241e:

    # isa "After that, we'll pick it up from where we left off."
    isa "之后我们继续从上次断掉的地方开始。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:684
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_923e492d:

    # mc "Would you...?"
    mc "你要是想的话，可以跟我爸见个面？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:685
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_5dc51a55:

    # mc "Would you like to meet my dad?"
    mc "你愿意见见我爸爸吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:687
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_136715e1:

    # isa "Are you sure about this?"
    isa "你确定吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:689
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_4cdb64f0:

    # mc "I'm rarely sure about things I blurt out like that..."
    mc "我很少确定自己那些脱口而出的话到底对不对。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:690
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_53598b8d:

    # mc "And I'm not sure how he would take it... But yeah..."
    mc "而且我也不确定他会怎么想... 但总之..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:692
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_6b9e88a8:

    # mc "I don't want to keep this secret from him."
    mc "我不想瞒着他这个秘密。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:693
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_5b08eb94:

    # mc "He's so important to me; as are you."
    mc "他对我来说非常重要，就像你一样。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:695
translate schinese ep12_bella_solo_cont_label_cfe75707:

    # isa "Then, I'd love to meet him."
    isa "那我真的很想见见他。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:710
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_86a46447:

    # isa "Isabella."
    isa "Isabella。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:712
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_ecfee261:

    # dad "Isabella... I'm Neil."
    dad "Isabella... 我是Neil。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:714
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_af41f771:

    # isa "[name] has told me plenty about you."
    isa "[name]他跟我说了很多关于你的事情。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:716
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_f2ccec63:

    # dad "All good things, I hope."
    dad "一切安好，希望如此。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:718
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_203120e5:

    # isa "He adores you."
    isa "他超喜欢你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:720
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_c1352763:

    # dad "That's always nice to hear."
    dad "听到这样的事总是挺让人开心的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:721
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_cfb86583:

    # dad "Come in. Coffee?"
    dad "进来吧。喝点咖啡？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:723
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_92e2ec78:

    # isa "I'd love some."
    isa "我也想要一些。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:725
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_35b72cc3:

    # dad "I'll get right on it."
    dad "我马上处理。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:727
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_0c0c8f7c:

    # mc "Feeling nervous?"
    mc "感觉紧张吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:729
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_c6b500b0:

    # isa "I did, on my way over here. But he seems easy-going."
    isa "我路上已经说了，但他看起来挺随和的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:731
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_a9bce381:

    # mc "I tried to prepare him as well as I could without oversharing."
    mc "我尽量在他心里种下了些好印象，但没说得太多。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:732
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_dbefff21:

    # mc "He knows you're my teacher and that we met before that."
    mc "他知道你是我的老师，而且我们之前就见过面。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:734
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_14f3e2af:

    # isa "That's good to know. What else?"
    isa "这挺好的。还有什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:736
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_f3a41b24:

    # mc "He knows your age and that I love you."
    mc "他知道你的年龄，也知道我爱你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:738
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_c5fb8e39:

    # isa "You told him that?"
    isa "你告诉他了？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:740
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_ce5b80f9:

    # mc "It felt like a natural thing to tell him. Shouldn't I have?"
    mc "告诉他感觉很自然。难道我不该说吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:742
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_9339fc8c:

    # isa "I didn't expect you to tell him that part. But that was sweet of you."
    isa "我没想到你会告诉他那部分。不过你这么做挺甜的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:744
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_3591d2a2:

    # dad "Sugar or milk, Isabella?"
    dad "糖还是奶，Isabella？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:746
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_ff85e2f5:

    # isa "Neither, thanks."
    isa "也不来，谢谢。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:748
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_b8fd63db:

    # dad "Kindred spirits, we all are."
    dad "同类人，我们都是。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:749
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_805b6514:

    # dad "I've tried milk and sugar, but it didn't feel right. And I don't get all these coffee drinks that people go for these days."
    dad "我试过加牛奶和糖，但感觉不对劲。现在这些咖啡饮料，我完全不懂为什么大家这么喜欢。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:750
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_e610aa21:

    # dad "Grande latte and tall mochaccinos... Why can't coffee simply be small or large? Why do they have to complicate things?"
    dad "大杯拿铁和小杯摩卡...咖啡为什么不能直接叫小杯或大杯？非要搞得这么复杂？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:752
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_61f9a6a0:

    # isa "Well, I assume if they called it \"tepid bean juice\", they wouldn't sell as much."
    isa "那他们要是叫它“温吞豆汁”，估计卖得也不多。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:754
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_be68d7cb:

    # dad "HAHA! Now that's a catchy name. Some black, tepid bean juice is coming right up."
    dad "哈哈！这名字真带劲。来点黑咖啡，温吞的豆汁儿。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:757
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_62022797:

    # mc "Eww. It sounds disgusting that way."
    mc "呸。这么说听起来真恶心。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:759
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_e4baf38b:

    # dad "Where are you from, Isabella?"
    dad "你从哪儿来的，Isabella？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:761
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_55139309:

    # isa "I'm a local."
    isa "我是本地人。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:763
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_e295167b:

    # dad "You don't say. Well, I didn't fly too far from home either."
    dad "你这话可真有意思。我也没飞太远离开家。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:764
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_6ec66c0b:

    # dad "This place has its charm."
    dad "这里也有它的魅力。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:766
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_96b0beee:

    # dad "[name] told me that you're a librarian."
    dad "[name]告诉我你是个图书管理员。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:768
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_acf449e0:

    # isa "You've been well-informed. I am."
    isa "你消息倒是挺灵通。我就是。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:770
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_6049ceb0:

    # dad "Always has been?"
    dad "一直如此？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:772
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_ced9cd04:

    # isa "I went to college with that profession in mind. I love to read."
    isa "我上大学就是奔着这个专业去的。我超爱读书。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:774
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_e594603f:

    # dad "So do I. There's nothing better than ending the night with a book."
    dad "我也是。没有什么比结束夜晚时读一本书更棒了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:775
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_5c119dc4:

    # dad "It takes the mind to a different place. I find it easier to fall asleep after reading."
    dad "读书能让人思维进入另一个地方。我读完书后更容易入睡。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:777
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_1b10228e:

    # isa "And you work in construction, right?"
    isa "你也在做建筑行业的工作吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:779
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_2c634615:

    # dad "I swing the old hammer."
    dad "我抡着老锤子。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:781
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_5b68c60f:

    # mc "Dad's been working in construction since his early teens."
    mc "我爸从十几岁起就一直干建筑。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:783
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_27ced4c8:

    # dad "It's a great job. People will always need housing and repairs."
    dad "这可是个好活计。人们永远都需要住房子和修缮。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:784
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_cc615d79:

    # dad "It takes its toll on the body, but I doubt I'd be in better shape without it."
    dad "这种活儿对身体伤害挺大，但我怀疑要是没干这活儿，我状态也不会好到哪儿去。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:787
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_2a7d64e4:

    # isa "[name] once helped me paint my fence, and he's done a great job with his room at the fraternity."
    isa "[name]曾经帮我刷过篱笆，他现在在兄弟会的房间里也做得很好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:789
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_99fca766:

    # isa "[name] has done a great job with his room at the fraternity."
    isa "[name]他把兄弟会的房间打理得很好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:790
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_5edd3f38:

    # isa "Your handy genes seem to run in the family."
    isa "你的手艺基因似乎也遗传自家族。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:792
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_5bb72ecf:

    # dad "That they do, but this one is too brilliant for me."
    dad "他们确实很擅长，但这个家伙太聪明了，我完全比不上。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:793
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_8a849013:

    # dad "I never had any aptitude for academia, but I'm happy he does."
    dad "我从来没对学术这方面有什么天赋，但看到他有这方面的才能，我挺高兴的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:795
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_643a47ed:

    # mc "What a boring world it would be if everyone liked the same things."
    mc "要是人人都喜欢同样的东西，那世界得多无聊啊。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:797
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_f99d3ce9:

    # dad "True. But I'm happy I could impart some wisdom to you. Nowadays, when he talks, I can't even understand half of what he says."
    dad "确实。但很高兴能给你传授一些智慧。现在，他一说话，我连一半都听不懂。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:799
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_6e22c3f9:

    # isa "Haha."
    isa "哈哈。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:801
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_99b97fe3:

    # mc "Tsk. You're not stupid, Dad."
    mc "啧。你不是傻瓜，老爸。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:803
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_bf140549:

    # dad "How was the bean juice?"
    dad "这杯豆奶怎么样？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:805
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_c862a6cc:

    # mc "Can we stop calling it that?"
    mc "我们能不能别这么叫了？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:807
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_37f7d8bd:

    # isa "It hit the spot."
    isa "正中要害。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:809
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_f2a5d963:

    # dad "Good."
    dad "好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:810
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_53b70b81:

    # dad "Isabella... I must admit, I was taken aback when [name] told me about you."
    dad "Isabella... 我必须承认，当我听到...[name]告诉我关于你的情况。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:811
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_cba83e75:

    # dad "I don't want you to feel uneasy about it, but I'm sure you understand why I had some reservations."
    dad "我不想让你因此感到不安，但你肯定明白我为什么有些犹豫。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:813
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_497c2b53:

    # isa "I do. As I told [name], I felt a tad nervous coming here today."
    isa "我确实如此。正如我告诉[name]我今天来这里感觉有点紧张。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:814
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_7a455430:

    # isa "Our situation is out of the ordinary, for many reasons..."
    isa "我们的处境有些特别，有很多原因。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:815
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_d74a2837:

    # isa "But in the end..."
    isa "但最终..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:817
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_dc4626dc:

    # mc "It feels right."
    mc "这感觉对。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:819
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_403c1274:

    # isa "It does. He can be mature when he wants to."
    isa "确实如此。他想的时候也能很成熟。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:820
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_005be0df:

    # isa "I hope that I'm not putting you in a weird spot here."
    isa "我希望我没有让你陷入尴尬的处境。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:822
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_2263a505:

    # dad "That's empathetic of you. I'm not the one to lack empathy either. Granted, I just met you, but you seem genuine."
    dad "你这话说得挺有同理心。我可不差这点。虽然我刚认识你，但你看起来挺真诚的。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:823
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_4c3ad9c5:

    # dad "Undeniably, this is a tad weird. But if this is something you both want..."
    dad "毫无疑问，这有点奇怪。但如果你们两个都想要的话……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:824
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_ab3d3c7c:

    # dad "Nothing makes me happier than seeing my son happy."
    dad "没有什么比看到我的儿子开心更让我高兴了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:826
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_554a840b:

    # mc "I'm relieved, Dad. Thank you."
    mc "我松了口气，爸。谢谢你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:827
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_e20b08e3:

    # mc "I had a lot of different scenarios playing in my head before I told you about Bella."
    mc "我脑子里想了很多种可能的情况，才敢告诉你贝拉的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:829
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_c84ada97:

    # dad "Oh, is Bella what you prefer to be called?"
    dad "哦，你是想叫她贝拉吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_isabella_branch.rpy:831
translate schinese ep12_bhome_label_fda2e94c:

    # mc "Haha! It took me a while until she allowed me to call her that."
    mc "哈哈！我花了一段时间才让她允许我这么叫她。"

